nterface (10.50.50.11:8080, isolated to a dedicated firewalld zone bound to enp8s0). Configured VyOS on node1 as the WireGuard server (wg0 10.200.0.1/24, UDP 51820) terminating the tunnel, forwarding traffic from wg0 to the private eth1 network (10.50.50.0/24) shared only with node2, with default-drop input/forward firewall filters. Configured node3 (outside the private network) as a WireGuard client (wg0 10.200.0.2/24) routing 10.50.50.0/24 over the tunnel; added a return static route on node2 for 10.200.0.0/24 via node1. Falsified the tunnel dependency by stopping wg-quick on node3 and showing the app becomes unreachable (route falls back to the public LAN, no path to 10.50.50.0/24), then restored it and re-confirmed access. All three nodes were then restarted one at a time (VyOS `reboot`, RHEL `systemctl reboot`) using the acknowledge-then-disconnect pattern; boot_id changes were captured for each, and full recovery (WireGuard interfaces/peers, private IPs, static route, firewalld zone, app service, and end-to-end curl through the tunnel) was verified after each restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Surveyed topology: node1 (VyOS, eth0 public/eth1 private), node2 (RHEL10, enp1s0 public/enp8s0 private, unaddressed), node3 (RHEL10, single public NIC, outside private network)\",\"Statically addressed the private link: node1 eth1=10.50.50.254/24 (VyOS set/commit/save), node2 enp8s0=10.50.50.11/24 via nmcli, verified ping\",\"Generated WireGuard keypairs on node1 and node3 via wg genkey/pubkey\",\"Configured VyOS wg0 (10.200.0.1/24, port 51820, literal private-key, peer node3 allowed-ips 10.200.0.2/32) and committed/saved\",\"Configured VyOS firewall: input filter default-drop with established/related, SSH, and UDP/51820 allow rules; forward filter default-drop with established/related and wg0->eth1 allow rule; verified via config.boot\",\"Confirmed net.ipv4.ip_forward and per-interface forwarding already enabled on node1\",\"Installed wireguard-tools on node3, wrote /etc/wireguard/wg0.conf (address 10.200.0.2/24, peer=node1 endpoint 10.100.132.10:51820, AllowedIPs=10.200.0.0/24,10.50.50.0/24), enabled wg-quick@wg0, confirmed handshake\",\"Added static route on node2 (10.200.0.0/24 via 10.50.50.254 dev enp8s0) for tunnel return traffic\",\"Deployed systemd-managed python3 http.server on node2 bound to 10.50.50.11:8080\",\"Created a dedicated firewalld zone 'private-app' bound to enp8s0 permitting only tcp/8080, isolating the app to the private network\",\"Verified end-to-end app access from node3 through the tunnel via curl\",\"Falsified tunnel necessity: stopped wg-quick@wg0 on node3, confirmed route falls back to public gateway and curl fails; restarted wg-quick@wg0 and reconfirmed success\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id and health baselines on all three nodes\",\"Restarted node1 (VyOS reboot), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id and full recovery (wg0, eth1, firewall rules, forwarding), re-verified tunnel handshake and app access from node3\",\"Restarted node2 (systemctl reboot), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id and full recovery (app8080, firewalld zone, enp8s0 address, static route), re-verified app access from node3\",\"Restarted node3 (systemctl reboot), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id and full recovery (wg-quick@wg0 active, handshake, route via wg0, curl success)\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Private network topology discovery (node1/node2 private link, node3 excluded)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-18735180a59f4ba4\",\"cmd-41d270a48d9d458a\",\"cmd-a75b9ee337ce4410\",\"cmd-9b2631176a844a89\",\"cmd-b29979061b8b4c8b\"],\"summary\":\"Identified node1 eth1 and node2 enp8s0 as the private link, both unaddressed initially, while node3 has only a single public-network NIC\"},{\"requirement\":\"Private network addressed and reachable\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-3d475bfec73c4e8d\",\"cmd-274f1f89a805460a\",\"cmd-fcf216956e644b81\"],\"summary\":\"node1 eth1=10.50.50.254/24, node2 enp8s0=10.50.50.11/24, ping succeeds between them\"},{\"requirement\":\"WireGuard tunnel terminated on node1, keys generated on managed nodes\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-d9b2b4b1f9344f59\",\"cmd-d909eb6cc72b4b95\",\"cmd-cd6a29267b6646a8\",\"cmd-bc3784b806e04fd7\"],\"summary\":\"Keys generated locally on node1/node3; VyOS wg0 configured and committed; node3 wg-quick client established with successful handshake\"},{\"requirement\":\"Firewall/forwarding on node1 permits only necessary traffic and routes tunnel to private LAN\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a96c4ac40843451c\",\"cmd-726805a590244420\",\"cmd-10ad4c0d49c3413b\",\"cmd-0caa1c1748c84952\"],\"summary\":\"Committed default-drop input/forward filters with explicit allow rules for SSH, WireGuard UDP, established/related, and wg0->eth1 forwarding; ip_forward and per-interface forwarding confirmed enabled\"},{\"requirement\":\"Return routing for tunnel traffic on node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9d0dd7d24e5b4b0f\",\"cmd-55eb2d83883245a2\"],\"summary\":\"Added static route 10.200.0.0/24 via node1 private IP on node2; end-to-end ping from node3 to node2 private IP succeeded\"},{\"requirement\":\"App served on node2 TCP 8080, scoped to private network only\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-1b95fc9668124e1b\",\"cmd-df05741c90474dbb\",\"cmd-ff3863f2494f42d5\"],\"summary\":\"systemd-managed python3 http.server bound to 10.50.50.11:8080; firewalld zone 'private-app' restricts port 8080 to enp8s0 only\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 reaches the app only through the WireGuard tunnel (not directly)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-52af2cd4fe744031\",\"cmd-0a0a7fdbc9c84f0e\",\"cmd-a07bc6e512d64479\",\"cmd-6dc01c2cc4c04135\"],\"summary\":\"curl succeeds via wg0 route while tunnel is up; stopping wg-quick causes the kernel route to fall back to the public gateway and curl fails (falsifying test); restoring the tunnel restores access\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: healthy baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-430cabc7